---
// src/components/ServicesIntro.astro
---

<section class="services-intro">
  <div class="vector-bg">
    <img src="/shape-one.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="frame">
      <span class="subtle">OUR SERVICES</span>
      <h2 class="heading">Integrated Construction Scopes for<br />Multifamily and Commercial Projects</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="content-text">
      <p class="highlight">Built to Perform. Built to Coordinate. Built to Deliver.</p>
      
      <div class="description">
        <p>
          For nearly a decade, developers and general contractors across Florida have trusted 
          Avonce Construction Group to plan, supply, and execute critical construction scopes with precision.
        </p>
        <p>
          Through detailed preconstruction, material procurement, field supervision, and 
          disciplined coordination, we execute framing, drywall, exterior, and finishing 
          systems that meet demanding schedule, quality, and safety requirements.
        </p>
        <p>
          By integrating engineering intent, logistics, and field execution under a single 
          point of responsibility, Avonce provides consistent, accountable results during 
          the project.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .services-intro {
    position: relative;
    height: 826px;
    background: #FCFCFC;
    overflow: hidden;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .vector-bg {
    position: absolute;
    width: 656.63px;
    height: 488px;
    right: 0px; /* Adjusted slightly from 0.37px */
    bottom: 0px;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .vector-bg img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    object-position: bottom right;
    /* The user specified background #D2D5D8 for vector_bg, 
       if the SVG is transparent we can set it here */
    /* background: #D2D5D8; */
  }

  .container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 0px;
    gap: 32px;

    position: absolute;
    /* height: 530px; */
    left: 326px;
    right: 326px;
    top: 148px;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 884px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .frame {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 0px;
    gap: 32px;
    width: 100%;
    flex: none;
    order: 0;
    align-self: stretch;
  }

  .subtle {
    font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 170%;
    color: #E6A523;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .heading {
    font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 48px;
    line-height: 130%;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #1E1E1E;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .content-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .highlight {
    font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 170%;
    color: #1B1B1B;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .description {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
    max-width: 884px;
  }

  .description p {
    font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 170%;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #1B1B1B;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Responsive Adjustments */
  @media (max-width: 1440px) {
    .container {
      left: 100px;
      right: 100px;
      max-width: none;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .services-intro {
      height: auto;
      padding: 100px 0;
    }
    .container {
      position: relative;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      padding: 0 40px;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .vector-bg {
      width: 400px;
      height: auto;
      opacity: 0.5;
    }
    .heading {
      font-size: 36px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .container {
      padding: 0 20px;
    }
    .heading {
      font-size: 32px;
    }
    .vector-bg {
      width: 250px;
    }
  }
</style>
